  "body": "### Summary\nAs a user, I want images in topics to load without a setting to manage, as in the legacy app, so that the settings stay short and nobody misses images because of a forgotten choice.\n\nMilestone: **M4**. Source: operator UI comparison of 2026-11-14, capture 05 (Plus › Réglages).\n\n### Legacy (reference `87fe0d1c`)\n- The operator removed this setting from legacy on purpose, to keep the settings list reasonable.\n- Legacy forces `display_images = \"yes\"` at every launch (`Classes/HFRplusAppDelegate.m:117-118`), so the branch that reads it (`HFRswift/Wrapped/LinkItem.m:149`) never hides an image.\n\n### Today (SwiftHFR @ `37c099b5`)\n- Réglages › Général › « Images externes » (Jamais / Wi-Fi uniquement / Toujours), `App/SwiftHFR/Settings/SettingsView.swift:97`, stored as `SettingKey.displayImages` (`App/SwiftHFR/Settings/GeneralSettingsModel.swift:52-53, 115`).\n- Image policy C (GAP-056, LOT-083, LOT-107, FEAT-011): Wi-Fi auto, cellular on tap.\n\n### Requested (operator, 2026-11-14)\n- Remove the setting.\n- **Always load images, cellular included**: the Wi-Fi-only and tap-to-load behaviours go with it.\n- Out of scope: the privacy parts of policy C that are not about *when* to load (cookie-less image client, no private hosts) stay as they are.\n- Do not add other settings in its place: the settings list stays as reviewed in legacy.\n\n### Scope\n- Drop the picker and make the reader's image mode « always ».\n- Persistence: a stored `display_images` value written by an earlier build is read and ignored (no crash, no migration prompt).\n- Ledger: `gap-edit` of GAP-056 in the PR's `### Ledger` section (back to legacy on when to load).\n\n### Acceptance criteria\n- [ ] No « Images externes » row in Réglages.\n- [ ] On cellular (Network Link Conditioner or a test seam), images load without a tap.\n- [ ] A build carrying a stored « never » value shows images after the update.\n\nRelated: #513 (M5 image viewer), #268.\n\n### Decision (operator, 2026-11-14)\n\n- **Default: always load images**, as legacy and as asked here. The main Réglages list loses the « Images externes » row.\n- **The choice is kept:** the Jamais / Wi-Fi uniquement / Toujours picker moves to **Réglages › Expérimental › Chargement des images** (a sub-menu of #903, option `imageLoadingChoice`, default « Toujours »). Code under `App/SwiftHFR/Experimental/ImageLoadingChoice/`, marked `// EXPERIMENTAL(imageLoadingChoice, #902)` where it overrides the default.\n- Privacy parts of policy C (cookie-less image client, no private hosts) unchanged.\n- Starts after #903.\n\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
